  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of the plane <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> measured in the direction with the direction ratios <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
