  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Direction ratios given are <math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></math><br />The line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br />Any general point on this line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2,2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />If it lies on the plane <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />The point on the plane is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and its distance from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
